    "diagnosis": "Sinonasal alveolar rhabdomyosarcoma",
    "title": "",
    "legend": "At high magnification, the rhabdoid appearance of the cells can be seen, with opaque, eccentric cytoplasm. Mitotic figures are easily identified.",
    "source": "Lester D.R. Thompson",
    "copyright": "",
    "tablehtml": "",
