    "diagnosis": "Sinonasal alveolar rhabdomyosarcoma",
    "title": "",
    "legend": "There is an intact respiratory epithelium. The stroma is busy, filled with small cells showing a high N:C&nbsp;ratio and rhabdoid features. Sometimes this appearance may mimic inflammatory sinonasal polyps.",
