    "diagnosis": "Embryonal rhabdomyosarcoma",
    "title": "",
    "legend": "A pleomorphic spindled cell population is noted adjacent to the cartilage in this ear embryonal rhabdomyosarcoma. Strap cells are present, a finding that helps to confirm a rhabdomyosarcoma diagnosis.",
